  "component-o": {
    "type-s": "wifi-module",
    "vendor-s": "Cypress Semiconductor (Infineon Technologies)",
    "description-s": "Single-chip IEEE 802.11 b/g/n 2.4 GHz WLAN MAC/baseband/radio with integrated Bluetooth 5.2 compliance. Integrates a power amplifier (PA), low-noise amplifier (LNA), and an internal transmit/receive (iTR) RF switch sharing a single 2.4 GHz antenna between WLAN and Bluetooth. The WLAN host interface supports gSPI and SDIO v2.0 modes (raw data transfer rate up to 200 Mbps in 4-bit mode at 50 MHz). An independent high-speed UART is provided for the Bluetooth host interface (HCI), with PCM for audio. Includes an integrated power management unit with an internal switching regulator operating from a battery voltage of 3.0V to 4.8V. Supplied in a 63-ball WLBGA package (4.87 mm x 2.87 mm, 0.4 mm pitch); operating ambient temperature -30 to +70 C.",
